WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.560
You moved abroad, you got a survival job, you're paying your bills, but is that the whole plan?

00:04.560 --> 00:10.000
So many immigrants work incredibly hard between range, family responsibilities, and daily expenses.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.760
It can feel like there's no room to think about, okay, what comes next?

00:13.760 --> 00:17.920
A better future starts with asking different questions. What skills can I develop?

00:17.920 --> 00:21.200
What opportunities can I explore? Who can I learn from?

00:21.200 --> 00:24.800
This is why the diaspora wealth network is hosting a free webinar

00:24.800 --> 00:30.640
to discuss practical ways immigrants can develop skills, ways they can explore opportunities,

00:30.640 --> 00:35.440
and even make more informed financial decisions, whether it's in the area of investment, whether

00:35.440 --> 00:38.640
it's in the area of real estate, whether it's in the area of career progression.

00:38.640 --> 00:43.520
If you want a clearer path for what comes next, register for our free webinar by using the

00:43.520 --> 00:47.760
registration link on the screen to save your space, or you could just send me a DM and ask

00:47.760 --> 00:51.280
me to send you a link directly, or you drop a comment and I will come to your DM and drop

00:51.280 --> 00:55.600
the link for you. I can't wait to see you guys. There's so much to explore, especially if you're

00:55.600 --> 01:02.640
an immigrant living anywhere in the diaspora, be it Canada, UK, US, Australia, Europe, this is for you.

